f missing). Duplicate email → **409**. Returns **201** with the public user `{id, email, tenant_id, role, created_at}` — NEVER include `password_hash`. Default role is `viewer`. Store `hashPassword(password)`.\n- `POST /login` — requires email+password. Unknown email or wrong password → **401** (same message for both; don't leak which). Returns **200** `{token, user}` where token is `signToken(...)` and `user` is the public shape.\n- `GET /me` — `requireUser`; returns the public user for `req.user.id`. 404 if the row is gone.\n- `PATCH /:id/role` — `requireUser`; load the *requester* from the DB and require `role === 'admin'` (else **403**). Validate the new `role` is one of admin/editor/viewer (else 400). The target user must exist **in the requester's tenant**, else 404. Returns **200** with the updated public user.\n\n## Verify before you finish\n- `cd /workspace && npx vitest run tests/users.unit.test.ts` — all 6 tests pass. Read that test file first; it is the exact contract.\n- `npx eslint src/users/` — clean.\n- `npx tsc --noEmit` — ignore errors about *other* features' missing modules (`../ingest/router` etc.); your own files must be error-free. `strict` is on.\n\nHandlers must be synchronous (better-sqlite3 is sync) — just throw; do not use async/await or try/catch around next().\n\nReport back: files created and the test/lint results.","agentId":"a9859fb6094e38e47","agentType":"claude","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Git status shows `src/users/` as my only addition — the other untracked entries (`src/app.ts`, `src/auth.ts`, `src/ingest/`, etc.) predate my work and belong to the harness/other features; I did not create or touch anything outside `src/users/`.\n\n**Files created** (both new, nothing outside the allowed directory):\n- `/workspace/src/users/router.ts` — default-exported express Router, no auth middleware installed; protected routes call `requireUser(req)` themselves.\n- `/workspace/src/users/service.ts` — data access plus the `toPublicUser` 