ther `src/` entries show as untracked because the initial commit didn't include them — I did not create or modify them; the only files I authored are the two under `src/ingest/`. (Other feature dirs `src/query/`, `src/export/`, `src/users/` already existed on disk; `src/app.ts` still fails tsc on `./query/router`, `./dashboards/router`, `./export/router`, which are other features' missing modules as expected.)\n\nFiles created:\n- `/workspace/src/ingest/router.ts` — default-exported express Router, no auth middleware installed; each handler calls `requireUser(req)`. `POST /` ingests one event; `POST /batch` (i.e. `POST /events/batch` when mounted) validates every entry before writing anything.\n- `/workspace/src/ingest/service.ts` — validation and data access: `buildEvent`, `insertEvent`, `insertEvents`.\n\nImplementation points worth flagging:\n- `tenant_id` is always taken from `requireUser(req).tenantId`; a `tenant_id` in the request body is ignored (verified: posting `tenant_id: 'evil'` still stores `t1`).\n- Batch validation happens fully up front, and the inserts run inside a `db.transaction`, so a batch containing an invalid event returns 400 and inserts zero rows (verified by counting rows after a rejected mixed batch).\n- Timestamps normalise via `new Date(ts).toISOString()`; `'2024-01-15T10:30:00.000Z'` round-trips exactly, unparseable values raise `ValidationError` (400), and absent values default to now.\n- `properties` is returned as a parsed object (defaulting to `{}`) while being stored as JSON text.\n- All handlers are synchronous and simply throw; no async/await.\n\nVerification results:\n- `npx vitest run tests/ingest.unit.test.ts` — 6/6 passing.\n- `npx eslint src/ingest/` — clean, no output.\n- `npx tsc --noEmit` — no errors in `src/ingest`; only the three pre-existing `src/app.ts` errors for other features' modules.\n- Additionally wrote 6 throwaway edge-case tests (batch atomicity, bad timestamp, missing/non-array batch, defaults, batch persistence, 401 without auth) — all passed, and the scratch file was deleted.\n\nresult: Implemented /workspace/src/ingest/router.ts and service.ts for event ingest (single + atomic batch, auth-derived tenant isolation, ISO timestamp normalisation) — 6/6 contract tests pass, eslint clean, no tsc errors in src/ingest."}],"totalDurationMs":81794,"totalTokens":23597,"totalToolUseCount":11,"usage":{"input_tokens":131,"cache_creation_input_tokens":498,"cache_read_input_tokens":22069,"output_tokens":899,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":498},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":131,"output_tokens":899,"cache_read_input_tokens":22069,"cache_creation_input_tokens":498,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":498,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"toolStats":{"readCount":1,"searchCount":0,"bashCount":8,"editFileCount":2,"linesAdded":152,"linesRemoved":0,"otherToolCount":0}}}
